<title>TAIWAN: Taiwan Sugar to tender for 10,000 tonnes US corn.</title>
<headline>Taiwan Sugar to tender for 10,000 tonnes US corn.</headline>
<dateline>TAIPEI 1997-03-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>State-owned Taiwan Sugar Corp will tender on Wednesday for a shipment of 10,000 tonnes U.S. corn, traders said on Monday.  </p>
<p>The tender will specify that sellers have the option for delivery dates, which can be any 20-day window in June.</p>
<p>Further details were not available.</p>
<p>-- George Hsu, Taipei newsroom (886-2-508-0815)</p>
